# pstack model configuration. One row per role. Delete a row to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model` and spawn `generalPurpose`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# defaults: 3
# budget: large (xhigh)

Choose one column before dispatch.
Use `normal` by default and `harder` when the work involves an unknown cause, interacting components, or a difficult design decision.
A blank `harder` cell uses `normal`.
Resolve each GPT family alias to the latest available model in that family supporting the listed effort.

